cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GeoSWE in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "GeoSWE: Geophysical Shallow-Water Engine"
abstract: >-
  GeoSWE is a GPU-accelerated finite-volume solver for the 2D nonlinear
  shallow-water equations, designed for flood modeling from coastal county to
  continental scale. It combines HLLC/Lax-Friedrichs fluxes, well-balanced
  surface reconstruction, implicit Manning friction, rainfall and coastal-stage
  forcings, and a compressed active-cell mesh that reaches continental scale on
  a single GPU node and scales across nodes with MPI.
type: software
